{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49388","headline":"月宫春 · 毛文锡","name":"月宫春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水晶宫里桂花开，神仙探几回。\n红芳金蘂绣重台，低倾玛瑙杯。\n玉兔银蟾争守护，姮娥姹女戏相偎。\n遥听钧天九奏，玉皇亲看来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}